{"candidateAnswer":"Laura and Cindy","evidence":"[D27:8 | 6:20 pm on 3 August, 2023] Maria: One of the residents at the shelter, Cindy, wrote it. It's a heartfelt expression of gratitude and shows the impact of the support they receive.\n[D21:19 | 8:43 pm on 3 July, 2023] Maria: One of the shelter residents, Laura, wrote us a letter expressing their gratitude. The impact we made on their life was inspiring!","itemId":"urn:uuid:b1c46752-c86e-53a9-a47a-cd60b3c4df37","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:890ba24a02d3ee1133c2272a4e380b6b928075820ef98a4a35744abe350ff33e","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"Who have written notes of gratitude to Maria?","referenceAnswer":"Cindy, Laura","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"890ba24a02d3ee1133c2272a4e380b6b928075820ef98a4a35744abe350ff33e"}}]}